            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khu ndaalo eya saba, eye kumwesi kwe khunyoa kwe kumwiiko kwe khumi na mulala kwe mbaambe yefwe, Omwami Wele aamboolela ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwana wo mundu, Ese nafunile Farao omwami owe Misiri kumukhono, mala lola, se kwaboilwe kimikhandaala kwiyonge kuone nio kunyoole kamaani kusute embalu tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako Ese Omwami WELE ndoma ndi, ‘Lola, Ese neaanyile khu Farao omwami owe Misiri. Ndafuna kamakhono kewe koombi sitube, kumulamu nende kukwafunwa, mala ndakhola embalu eanukhe ekwe khukhwama mu mukhono kwewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndasalanisia Bamisiri mu kholo choosi lundi ndabasalanisia mu bibala bioosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndara kamaani mu makhono ko mwami owa Babiloni mala mwakaanisie embalu yase. Ne kakhali ndafuna kamakhono ka Farao mala alalambaala ebweeni wewe ne alenya nga omundu niye baunile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndara kamaani mu makhono ko mwami owa Babiloni, ne kakhali kamakhono ka Farao kalakwa, mala balamanya bali Ese ndi Omwami Wele nga ndakaanisia embalu yase khu mwami owa Babiloni, alakibwaakalila sibala sia Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ese khasalanisie Bamisiri mu kholo chichiindi lundi mbasalanisie mu bibala bioosi. Nio, bamanye bali Ese ndi Omwami Wele.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
